    "long_instructions": "# AI Tool Exploration\r\n\r\nAI is appearing in many places, including in technology you may already use and stand-alone platforms. New AI tools are being released regularly, and existing tools are constantly adding new features. We've provided a sample of tools that can support your teaching practice, but there are many others out there.\r\n\r\n**Take time to explore AI tools on your own.**\r\n\r\nAs you explore and interact with these tools, keep the THINK framework in mind.\r\n\r\n<div style=\"width:50%; max-width:700px; margin:0 auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; color:#292F36;\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(41,47,54,0.06);\">\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\nT\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:12px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:15px;\">Task & Purpose</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\nH\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:12px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:15px;\">Human Oversight</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\nI\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:12px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:15px;\">Instructional Quality</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; border-bottom:1px solid #E8ECF0;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\nN\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:12px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:15px;\">No Sensitive Data</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ROW -->\r\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;\">\r\n<div style=\"background:#8C52BA; color:#FFFFFF; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\r\nK\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"padding:12px;\">\r\n<div style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:15px;\">Keep Professional Judgment First</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Reflection\r\n\r\n> In the reflection box below, share the following:\r\n> - One tool you found.\r\n> - One way you could use it to support your teaching practice.\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: left; margin:20px 0px 30px 0px\">\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://forum.code.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/7dbe63a051fbad4ef262d6ab710e2966-image-1731959037460.png\" style=\"width: auto; height: 100px;\"  alt=\"A browser with two text boxes, both including an avatar and lines of text.\"></a>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background-color: #007786; border-radius: 20px 20px 20px 20px; color: #000000; width: 80%; margin-left: 5%; margin-right: 5%; padding: 10px 10px 5px 10px;\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color: white; line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10px; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 18px\"><b>Post to the Code.org Forum</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color: white; line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 10px; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 18px\">Share your response and read other educators' ideas on the forum! Click on the icon to the left to direct to our forum post.\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
